        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  jsonrpc: '2.0',\n  method: 'call',\n  params: {\n    service: 'object',\n    method: 'execute_kw',\n    args: [\n      $env.ODOO_DB, $env.ODOO_UID, $env.ODOO_API_KEY,\n      'crm.lead', 'create',\n      [{\n        name: $json.company,\n        contact_name: $json.contact_name,\n        email_from: $json.email,\n        phone: $json.phone,\n        description: 'Industry: ' + $json.industry + ' | Employees: ' + $json.employee_count,\n        priority: String($json.priority),\n        x_studio_score_tier: $json.score_tier,\n        x_studio_linkedin_url: $json.linkedin_url,\n        x_studio_decision_makers: JSON.stringify($json.decision_makers || [])\n      }]\n    ]\n  }\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Requires env vars ODOO_URL, ODOO_DB, ODOO_UID, ODOO_API_KEY. Maps enriched fields into crm.lead, including two custom Odoo Studio fields (x_studio_score_tier, x_studio_decision_makers) - create these fields in Odoo Studio before running."
